patina-desktop (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaging of the compositor and top panel.
  * The panel shows the real time, battery (when present), focused window title and
    workspaces; the compositor has four workspaces.
  * Cursors other than the default arrow (text, resize and so on) come from the system
    XCursor theme, so a cursor theme is recommended.
  * Builds with a pinned rustup toolchain (packaging/RUST_VERSION) because the
    Rust in Debian 12 and Ubuntu 22.04 is too old.

 -- PatineDE contributors <patina@example.invalid>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:30:00 -0700
